  "releaseNotes": "# AID v2.1.6\n\n## 中文更新说明\n\n### 批量生成与媒体任务\n\n- 修复专业版多参数视频提示词在有效场景下遗漏项目全局风格的问题；空输出、缺少场景或时长仍按无效结果处理。\n- 媒体任务只截取安全长度的展示摘要，避免大批量提示词在入库阶段超过 `TEXT` 容量；完整请求与实际模型输入不变。\n- Web 批量视频部分失败时展示任务返回的安全失败原因，成功产物照常回填；普通生成、恢复和续生使用一致的提示。\n- 配音试听在供应商明确拒绝时返回可操作的安全提示，不再误报为缺少异步任务 ID。\n\n### 数据库与升级\n\n- `sql/v2.1.6.sql` 条件式修正已有库的菜单名称及早期媒体任务提示词摘要列字符集为 `utf8mb4`。新安装基线也使用相同字符集；迁移不覆盖已有数据或自定义配置，历史乱码仍须依据原始来源单独恢复。\n- 已在隔离 MySQL 5.7.20 实例从 `v1.0.0-beta.1` 初始化库顺序执行全部正式增量至本版，整条链重复执行两遍均成功。本版一键直升最低版本继续为 `v1.0.0-beta.1`。升级前请备份数据库、部署配置、证书及用户媒体。\n\n### 开源发布与文档\n\n- 统一公开仓地址为 `aid-studio`，更新安装、升级、Release、模型目录和社区入口；既有自定义配置不会被覆盖。\n- 优化中英文 README 的产品介绍与流程画布展示，增加英文 Docker、systemd、备份、HTTPS 和外部中间件部署指南；新增 Web 静态生成检查。\n- 本版包含服务端与 Web 用户端修复；后台管理端没有业务代码变化。\n\n## English Release Notes\n\n### Batch Generation and Media Tasks\n\n- Fixed missing project-wide style in valid professional multi-parameter video prompts. Empty output, missing scenes, and missing duration still fail validation.\n- Bounded the stored display summary of media-task prompts to avoid `TEXT` column overflow during large batches. Full requests and actual model inputs are unchanged.\n- The Web client now shows safe item-level reasons for partial video-batch failures while retaining successful outputs. Initial runs, recovery, and continuation use consistent messaging.\n- Voice preview now returns an actionable safe message when a provider explicitly rejects a request instead of reporting a missing asynchronous task ID.\n\n### Database and Upgrades\n\n- `sql/v2.1.6.sql` conditionally converts existing menu-name and legacy media-task prompt-summary columns to `utf8mb4`. The fresh-install baseline matches. Existing data and custom settings are preserved; previously corrupted text requires separate recovery from an authoritative source.\n- The full migration chain from the `v1.0.0-beta.1` baseline through this release passed twice on an isolated MySQL 5.7.20 instance. The minimum supported one-click upgrade version remains `v1.0.0-beta.1`. Back up the database, deployment configuration, certificates, and user media before upgrading.\n\n### Open-source Release and Documentation\n\n- Unified public repository URLs under `aid-studio` across installation, upgrades, Releases, model catalogs, and community links without overwriting existing custom configuration.\n- Refined the bilingual README and flow-canvas presentation, added English Docker/systemd and backup/HTTPS/external-service guidance, and added a Web static-generation check.\n- This release includes server and Web fixes; the admin application's business code is unchanged.",
